# Story 72: Cross-Pane AI Workflows (40s)
# Hook: Combine listening, inspection, and sending to solve problems across many panes at once.
# Duration: 40s
# Source: story-072-cross-pane-ai-workflows.tape
#
# Voiceover script with timing cues.
# Format: [START --> END] narration text
# Each entry should be spoken within its time window.
# Gaps between entries are silent (viewer watches the demo).
#
# Total segments: 5

[00:00.0 --> 00:03.0]
Combine listening, inspection, and sending to solve problems across many panes at once.

[00:03.0 --> 00:10.0]
Start rysh and create a couple of panes -- think of one as a server and one as a coordinator.

[00:10.0 --> 00:18.0]
From the coordinator pane, the agent lists every pane with agents_list to see what's running and where.

[00:18.0 --> 00:32.0]
Now it inspects a failing pane and uses pane_send to apply a fix there -- a full multi-pane workflow from one prompt.

[00:32.0 --> 00:40.0]
Listen, inspect, and send -- together they turn separate panes into one coordinated agentic team.

